@host = http://localhost:5080

### Public endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/sample/public
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Login; copy accessToken into the variable below
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "password": "demo-password-not-real" }

### Token returned by login
@accessToken = paste-token-here

### Protected endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/sample/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Role-protected endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/sample/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
